 proper inner-model class; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" href=\"?note=5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" title=\"58-df-inner-model\">58-df-inner-model</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,X,Y\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,X,Y\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal bound, small set of ordinals, and covering set).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S,\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CardinalLt}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S,\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CardinalLt}_S\\)</span> (inner-model and cardinal predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoveringProperty}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoveringProperty}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}covering\\text{-}property} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoveringProperty}_S[M,\\kappa]\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl((X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CardinalLt}_S(X,\\kappa))\\to\\exists Y\\in V\\;(Y\\in M\\land X\\subseteq Y\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CardinalLt}_S(Y,\\kappa))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}covering\\text{-}property} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoveringProperty}_S[M,\\kappa]\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl((X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CardinalLt}_S(X,\\kappa))\\to\\exists Y\\in V\\;(Y\\in M\\land X\\subseteq Y\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CardinalLt}_S(Y,\\kappa))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Square brackets mark the class parameter. Quantification over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> is set quantification, while membership in the possibly proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is metalinguistic; both ambient size bounds use the registered strict-cardinality predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-inner-model","status":"resolved","id":"5a435dbfefa9e0ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-inner-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-cardinal-lt","status":"resolved","id":"86c688a672128b44","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card6-cardinal-lt]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-inner-model","status":"resolved","id":"5a435dbfefa9e0ed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M$ (possibly proper inner-model class; see [[58-df-inner-model]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa,X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S,\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CardinalLt}_S","di